{"id":"7f8ff1ff1c7ad23b","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-thm-special-aronzajn.md","title":"Existence of a Special Aronszajn Tree","display":"thm-special-aronzajn — Existence of a Special Aronszajn Tree","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-special-aronzajn","aliases":["58-thm-special-aronzajn","Special Aronszajn Tree","Aronszajn Tree Decomposition"],"display":"thm-special-aronzajn — Existence of a Special Aronszajn Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-aronszajn-tree.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-omega1.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-special-aronzajn"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-special-aronzajn</span><span>Special Aronszajn Tree</span><span>Aronszajn Tree Decomposition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-special-aronzajn — Existence of a Special Aronszajn Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ddaf9aa303e4aaf7\" href=\"?note=ddaf9aa303e4aaf7\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-aronszajn-tree.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-aronszajn-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"27ae6ad867a7007d\" href=\"?note=27ae6ad867a7007d\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-omega1.md\">../batch17/58-df-omega1.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,R,c\\in V\">\\(T,R,c\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq T^2\">\\(R\\subseteq T^2\\)</span> is the tree order.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AronszajnTree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AronszajnTree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}special\\text{-}aronzajn}\\vdash\n\\exists T,R,c\\in V\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AronszajnTree}_S(T,R,\\omega_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,T,\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(s\\neq t\\land\n(\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle t,s\\rangle\\in R)\n\\to c(s)\\neq c(t)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}special\\text{-}aronzajn}\\vdash\n\\exists T,R,c\\in V\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AronszajnTree}_S(T,R,\\omega_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,T,\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(s\\neq t\\land\n(\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle t,s\\rangle\\in R)\n\\to c(s)\\neq c(t)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Each color class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c^{-1}(\\{n\\})\">\\(c^{-1}(\\{n\\})\\)</span> is an antichain, so the tree is a countable union of antichains.</li>\n<li>ZFC proves that a special <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>-Aronszajn tree exists. It does not prove that every Aronszajn tree is special; PFA does.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-aronszajn-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"ddaf9aa303e4aaf7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-aronszajn-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-omega1.md","status":"resolved","id":"27ae6ad867a7007d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-omega1.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,R,c\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AronszajnTree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}special\\text{-}aronzajn}\\vdash\n\\exists T,R,c\\in V\\;\\Bigl[{}&\n\\mathrm{AronszajnTree}_S(T,R,\\omega_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,T,\\omega)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(s\\neq t\\land\n(\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle t,s\\rangle\\in R)\n\\to c(s)\\neq c(t)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"c^{-1}(\\{n\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false}],"bytes":1246,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4428","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-thm-special-aronzajn.md|58-thm-special-aronzajn]]（batch10）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-261","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-thm-0-shar